    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "status": "Published",
      "published": true,
      "reopened": true,
      "reopenedVerified": true,
      "videoId": "oqziuQx8hLQ",
      "sourceAudioLanguage": "en",
      "srtFile": "data/four-denominations-guide-captions/en.srt",
      "localSrtFile": "outputs/four-denominations-video-guides-2026-10-20/captions/en.srt",
      "srtSHA256": "8b5146fbdae0cda876b6c660c3cf6758487cb8880ac0244b30e4a4a25b3d691f",
      "cueCount": 29,
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 1.07,
          "end": 1.59,
          "text": "So,"
        },
        {
          "start": 1.59,
          "end": 6.73,
          "text": "I'm standing here in the\nneighborhood that's called"
        },
        {
          "start": 6.73,
          "end": 10.25,
          "text": "the Four Religions Quarter."
        },
        {
          "start": 10.97,
          "end": 14.4,
          "text": "When I say four religions, I actually mean"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.4,
          "end": 17.31,
          "text": "three different streams of\nChristianity and Judaism."
        },
        {
          "start": 18.11,
          "end": 23.2,
          "text": "In this beautiful neighborhood you can\nfind three different kinds of churches"
        },
        {
          "start": 23.2,
          "end": 27.45,
          "text": "that serve three Christian streams,"
        },
        {
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.9,
          "text": "as well as a beautiful synagogue\ncalled the White Stork."
        },
        {
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 35.8,
          "text": "We visited that synagogue\non the last Yom Kippur,"
        },
        {
          "start": 35.8,
          "end": 40.19,
          "text": "and it was really an exciting experience."
        },
        {
          "start": 40.19,
          "end": 45.5,
          "text": "Moreover, this neighborhood is filled\nwith passages and little streets"
        },
        {
          "start": 45.5,
          "end": 49.3,
          "text": "filled with cafés and restaurants."
        },
        {
          "start": 49.3,
          "end": 53.11,
          "text": "I'm standing now in one of\nthe famous passages called"
        },
        {
          "start": 53.11,
          "end": 57.1,
          "text": "Pokoyhof. In translation it\nmeans the garden of Pokoy."
        },
        {
          "start": 57.1,
          "end": 61.8,
          "text": "Just at the entrance to this passage\nthere is a very nice café called Pokoy."
        },
        {
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 66.7,
          "text": "When you enter the passage,\nfirst of all you can be impressed"
        },
        {
          "start": 66.7,
          "end": 71.19,
          "text": "by this building, this kind of\ncourtyard that I'm standing in,"
        },
        {
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 76.55,
          "text": "with beautiful architecture\nand colorful tiles."
        },
        {
          "start": 76.55,
          "end": 79.4,
          "text": "Inside this passage you can find Starbucks."
        },
        {
          "start": 79.4,
          "end": 84.7,
          "text": "You can also find Charlotte's café,\nwhich is a French coffee house."
        },
        {
          "start": 84.7,
          "end": 90.79,
          "text": "You can find some bars and other restaurants."
        },
        {
          "start": 90.79,
          "end": 96.29,
          "text": "Just adjacent to here, there's a very\nfamous little street called Antoniego,"
        },
        {
          "start": 96.29,
          "end": 100.3,
          "text": "that is also filled with\nrestaurants and cafés."
        },
        {
          "start": 100.3,
          "end": 106.27,
          "text": "I recommend coming here and strolling in\nthose beautiful passages and little streets."
        },
        {
          "start": 106.27,
          "end": 110.95,
          "text": "Another passage that is very\ninteresting is the passage of neons."
        },
        {
          "start": 111.49,
          "end": 116.6,
          "text": "I recommend coming to this\npassage in the evening,"
        },
        {
          "start": 116.6,
          "end": 119.79,
          "text": "when all the neons are shining\nbright in beautiful colors."
        },
        {
          "start": 120.35,
          "end": 121.77,
          "text": "See you in our next video."
        },
        {
          "start": 122.63,
          "end": 123.8,
          "text": "Do widzenia!"
        }
      ],
      "allCueTextsAndTimesVerified": true,
